'''Wizard Wand''' is an {{Epic}} [[Wands|Wand]]. It can be obtained from [[Shen's Special]]. It displays the buyer's name, cost paid, and the details about in which auction it was sold and the ranking of the buyer within that auction. This data disappears if the item is traded in any way, and due to a bug, also when it returns from its ability. 

== Obtaining ==
The '''Wizard Wand''' can be bid on at [[Shen's Special]]. The top 20 bidders receive the item.

== Usage ==
When used, the '''Wizard Wand''' will be consumed, and a message will appear in chat. The Wand will disappear for 3-5 days, before appearing again with {{stat|int|+1}} (up to a maximum of {{stat|int|+100|icononly=yes}}).

